Introduction
============

About
-----

The ``ni.measurements.data.v2.client`` Python package provides a gRPC client
for the NI Data Store Service, version 2. The corresponding service is defined
in the ``ni.measurements.data.v2.proto`` package.

NI created and supports this package.

Operating System Support
------------------------

``ni.measurements.data.v2.client`` supports Windows and POSIX operating systems.

Python Version Support
----------------------

``ni.measurements.data.v2.client`` supports CPython 3.10+.

Installation
------------

You can directly install the ``ni.measurements.data.v2.client`` package using
``pip`` or by listing it as a dependency in your project's ``pyproject.toml``
file.
